{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Bugs will likely be present that slipped through the cracks during BETA. Please report them so they can be addressed. Book Two will feature chapters 5 &amp; 6 off the bat, followed by 7 when it's ready and finally 8 thereafter. The remaining books (Books 3 &amp; 4) will be released as separate DLCs.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The next installment of Artemis picks up immediately after Book One's conclusion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Book Two, you will help Artemis understand what it means to be human, as you guide her through various scenarios and prepare her to be a member of society. Some choices will influence a new core mechanic,<strong> Artemis' Discernment Protocol</strong>. This will affect how she handles situations in future chapters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738540/extras/art_01.gif?t=1749461278\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will also navigate the corporate world, as you revive Kapuletti Industries back to its former glory and prepare for the McCreed Expo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738540/extras/ch5_scn24_77.png?t=1749461278\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And of course, advance your progression with love interests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738540/extras/artb2_02.gif?t=1749461278\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738540/extras/artlewd.gif?t=1749461278\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3738540?t=1749461278","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3738540?t=1749461278","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738540/b481da4551b39da2e15989d4613e9b43de93bf7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749461278","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738540/b481da4551b39da2e15989d4613e9b43de93bf7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749461278","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Sexual acts are in the narrative dependent on your status with a love interest. Some discussions of drugs and alcohol. And sensitive topics such as surviving attempted suicide and the healing process."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Bugs will likely be present that slipped through the cracks during BETA. Please report them so they can be addressed. Book Two will feature chapters 5 &amp; 6 off the bat, followed by 7 when it's ready and finally 8 thereafter. The remaining books (Books 3 &amp; 4) will be released as separate DLCs.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The next installment of Artemis picks up immediately after Book One's conclusion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Book Two, you will help Artemis understand what it means to be human, as you guide her through various scenarios and prepare her to be a member of society. Some choices will influence a new core mechanic,<strong> Artemis' Discernment Protocol</strong>. This will affect how she handles situations in future chapters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img clas